    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0140_5c527b2adf1e.png\" style=\"width: 207px; height: 158px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>&#8728;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
